:"Click here","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/eastidahonews-com-code-of-ethics/#onlinecommenting","line":122}],"metadata":{"title":"Water supply stress ahead for east Idaho, NWS says","source":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/05/water-supply-stress-ahead-for-east-idaho-and-pacific-northwest-weather-experts-say/?emci=e554d6ac-2f4b-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&emdi=929c959b-9e4b-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&ceid=110103","author":["[[Logan Ramsey]]"],"published":"2026-05-08","created":"2026-07-08","description":"POCATELLO — After east Idaho’s warmest winter on record, regional weather experts say the forecast for the largest river system in the region is “bad news.” And the rest of the Pacific Northwest looks to be in either a similar, the same, or a worse situation. The National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration held a webinar […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},